# ulei interactive slice (user unit, ADR-0042 section 11): the units on the path of an owner turn,
# ulei-engine, ulei-inbox, ulei-tg, ulei-memory, ulei-hive-mcp and ulei-garden. It sets no IO, CPU or
# memory limit: each unit keeps its own MemoryMax and TasksMax, and a deployment that caps the IO of
# its background work in another slice keeps the owner's turn out of that budget. A hive_create of
# the engine's hive tools waited about 100 s for its SQLite writes in a slice capped at 80 read and
# 60 write IOPS.
[Unit]
Description=ulei units on the path of an owner turn
